  "claim": "The footers, queue line, and station of Big Bad Wolf were re-purposed for a roller coaster jointly designed by the park's creative design team and Zierer of Germany.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Big Bad Wolf (roller coaster). Sentence: Big Bad Wolf was a suspended roller coaster in the Oktoberfest section of Busch Gardens Williamsburg.\nPage: Big Bad Wolf (roller coaster). Sentence: The footers, queue line, and station were re-purposed for Verbolten, a roller coaster that was introduced in 2012.\nPage: Verbolten. Sentence: Verbolten is a Zierer multi-launching steel roller coaster that officially opened on May 18, 2012 at Busch Gardens Williamsburg in Williamsburg, Virginia after a soft opening began on Friday, May 11, 2012.\nPage: Verbolten. Sentence: The concept was jointly designed by the park's creative design team and by Zierer of Germany.",
